      "sections": [
        {
          "heading": "About us",
          "text": "Hi! Welcome to the Secret Garden. We’re Becky and John and this is our hotel! It’s in Gimmelwald. Gimmelwald is a small village (only 130 people) in the mountains. The hotel is in an old house with eight rooms."
        },
        {
          "heading": "Becky",
          "text": "Hello, I’m Becky. I’m 35 and I’m from Glasgow in the UK. I’m very happy here in Switzerland. The people are friendly, and the food is good. In the winter it’s very cold, but the mountains are beautiful. My favourite things in Gimmelwald are the cows on the mountains. They’re very happy!"
        },
        {
          "heading": "John",
          "text": "Hi, I’m John. I’m 34 and I’m married to Becky. I’m British too, but now Switzerland is our home. Our jobs aren’t easy – French and German are difficult for me. We’re very tired at night, but we’re happy. My favourite thing in Switzerland is the chocolate. It’s very good!"
        }
      ]
